---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — CopperTrace">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="article-meta">About</div>
    <h1>CopperTrace</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      An independent engineering notebook for electronics, embedded systems, RF,
      hardware debugging and reverse engineering.
    </p>

    <h2>What gets documented</h2>
    <p>
      The focus is practical engineering: measurements before assumptions, reproducible test
      setups, firmware and protocol investigation, hardware modifications, automation and the
      mistakes that lead to a better design.
    </p>

    <h2>Why publish it?</h2>
    <p>
      Many useful engineering discoveries are too specific to become products or formal papers,
      but they can still save someone else time — and they provide a permanent record of how a
      problem was approached and solved.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
